# The Nod score screen after a mission in which men died: the casualty bars
# and the men who fall beside them, which a mission won before a shot is fired
# never draws.
# args: -PLAYTEST
at 301 click 320 58
at 501 click 480 200
at 9001 keydown ALT
at 9002 key W
at 9005 keyup ALT
at 10000 shot score_counting
at 10800 shot casualties
at 11400 shot buildings_lost
at 11401 quit
